# SMTP2GO
 
> SMTP2GO is an email and SMS delivery service that sends, tracks, and reports on transactional and marketing messages over SMTP relay or a REST API. It's built for developers and businesses who want reliable inbox delivery without running their own mail infrastructure.
 
Founded in New Zealand in 2006, SMTP2GO handles delivery for 40,000+ businesses, with data centers in the US, Europe, and Australia. The content spans a few subdomains: marketing and setup live on smtp2go.com, API docs on developers.smtp2go.com, the help center on support.smtp2go.com, the account control panel on app.smtp2go.com, and uptime on smtp2gostatus.com. The developer docs also publish their own machine-readable index at https://developers.smtp2go.com/llms.txt.
 
